  "title": "Giancarlo N NDE 4721",
  "date": "1974",
  "content": "I was travelling by bike when I was hit by a car which continuing its run literally climbed on me causing me several fractures including the most serious cervical fracture of the 4th and 5th. During the investment, I was dead. A few minutes later (I think minutes) I saw myself from above and the car raised by the tow truck, a nurse, who then I identified at the hospital, who tried to revive me, and a priest who gave me the last rites on the street. Then I saw a huge bright light that was not blinding, indeed very nice. I saw a kind of obstacle and then the return at a speed rate that you cannot describe. I was shouting my dissent while I was running through a tunnel and finally the revival. I again went into a coma at the hospital during my hospitalization but I have never seen again the light.",
